      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my 4yo is burning up with a 103 fever. he weighs 42 lbs. i have that children's liquid acetaminophen (160mg/5ml). i was thinking of giving him 12ml to really get it under control since it's so high... is 12ml okay for his weight? i don't want to underdose him since he's acting so sick.",
